## 🔍 Admin Components Deep Review Gate (NO-WRITE)

Purpose: A read-only, evidence-backed audit of apps/client/src/components/admin/** and their consumers.
Output: AdminComponentsDeepDive.md + in-place updates to CLAUDE.md tickets.

Steps:
- Inventory all admin components & exports (rg export scan).
- Reference map (static refs, lazy/dynamic imports, registries, flags/cohorts).
- Data sources per component (axios/fetch hooks, sockets, events).
- Server parity checklist (RBAC middleware per endpoint/event).
- React 19 hygiene & perf/a11y quick checks.
- Decision per component: KEEP / CONSOLIDATE / DELETE with Confidence.

Exit: "Admin deletions unblocked" only after decisions are attached to each candidate item with evidence links.

